00:14:06.020 --> 00:14:08.820 position:80%
Our company itself uses payroll through blockchain.

00:14:09.860 --> 00:14:13.300 position:75%
All of our employees, team members, contractors,

00:14:13.300 --> 00:14:15.830 position:61%
